Casino craps for the CHGame handheld, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

It contains art and a font from "Blackjack" for the Arduboy by Press Play On
Tape - Simon Holmes (filmote), code, and Stephane C (vampirics), art:

    https://github.com/Press-Play-On-Tape/Blackjack   (commit 72a6b1b, 2022)

licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, by way of CHBlackjack
(https://github.com/bateske/CHBlackjack, the same author's colour port):

  * The dealer, here the stickman: PPOT's bust and face expressions,
    recoloured and retouched (tools/art/common/dealer.png), plus expressions drawn
    for CHBlackjack. tools/assets.py builds them into src/assets/Assets.cpp
    from the original's assets/ PNGs.
  * The 3x5 font (the CHGame library's
    platform/board/arduino/CHGame/libraries/CHGame/src/chgame/Draw.cpp, FONT35), extended with
    a few symbols.

New for this game: the rules, the dice cam and its 3D dice, the craps
layout, the "Craps" title lettering, the chips' and puck's sprites (drawn
from CHBlackjack's chip), the sound effects and the presentation. The
input, palette, effects, saving, sound and debug code comes from
CHBlackjack and CHChess by the same author.
